### 2. Bundle Size Optimization 📦

#### Issue: Entire lodash Library Imported
**File:** `src/app/compare/page.tsx`

**Before:**
```typescript
import { groupBy, sortBy, meanBy, sumBy, maxBy, minBy } from 'lodash';
```
- Bundle size: ~70KB
- Imports entire library even though only 6 functions used

**After:**
```typescript
// Replaced with native JavaScript implementations
const sorted = [...products].sort((a, b) => a.price - b.price);
const avgPrice = products.reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.price, 0) / products.length;
const totalReviews = products.reduce((sum, p) => sum + p.reviews, 0);
const bestRated = products.reduce((max, p) => p.rating > max.rating ? p : max);
```
